{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"You're responsible for continuing the writing of one and only one point in the overall answer to the following question.\n\n<question>\nCompose an engaging travel blog post about a recent trip to Hawaii, highlighting cultural experiences and must-see attractions.\n<\/question>\n\nThe skeleton of the answer is:\n\n<skeleton>\n1. Opening trip snapshot\n2. Island and cultural immersion\n3. Local food and traditions\n4. Must-see natural attractions\n5. Memorable recent moments\n6. Travel tips and reflection\n\n<\/skeleton>\n\nContinue and only continue the writing of point 5.\nWrite it **very shortly** in 1-2 sentences and do not continue with other points!"}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"response":{"type":"string"}},"required":["response"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}